{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"ba1ab46e42e784cde98e7b69dca91399dcc7d758951f802d5da0412989293c76","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":25,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列人被诱犯罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以色列人驻扎在什亭期间，有些人与摩押女子行淫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那些女子邀这些人祭祀她们的神明，他们吃了祭物，并跪拜她们的神明。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["结果以色列与巴力·毗珥苟合。耶和华大怒，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["对摩西说：“把为首的人都抓起来，当着我的面在大白天处死他们，以消除我对以色列人的怒气。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["于是，摩西对以色列的审判官说：“你们各自把手下与巴力·毗珥苟合的人处死。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["摩西和以色列全体会众正在会幕门口痛哭的时候，有个以色列人当着他们的面，把一个米甸女子带进自家的帐篷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["亚伦祭司的孙子、以利亚撒的儿子非尼哈看见了，便起身离开会众，拿着矛枪，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["跟着进入那人的帐篷，用枪刺透那对男女的腹部。以色列人当中的瘟疫马上止住了，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但已有两万四千人死于瘟疫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["“亚伦祭司的孙子、以利亚撒的儿子非尼哈，消了我对以色列人的怒气。因为在会众中他与我一样痛恨不贞，我才没有愤然消灭他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你告诉他，我要赐给他平安的约，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["使他和他的后代凭此约可以永远做祭司，因为他为我除掉了不贞之人，为以色列人赎了罪。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["与米甸女子一同被杀的以色列人名叫心利，是撒路的儿子，是西缅支派的一个族长。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["被杀的米甸女子名叫哥斯比，她父亲苏珥是米甸人的一个族长。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["“你要攻打米甸人，击杀他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["因为他们心存恶意，在毗珥陷害你们，他们的姊妹——米甸首领的女儿哥斯比诱惑你们，她在毗珥事件招来瘟疫之日被杀。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/25.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/26.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/24.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}